# Always show the One UI minor version number in the About Phone screen.
# Ported from UN1CA's customize.sh (was applied via SMALI_PATCH ... "replace",
# scoped to the isDeviceWithMicroVersion()Z method).
#
# Implemented here as a whole-file FIND_REPLACE instead of a method-scoped
# PATCH, since we don't have this controller's real modifiers/visibility to
# build an exact `.method ...` match against (needed to anchor a PATCH block).
# `move-result p0` immediately followed by `return p0` is very unlikely to
# occur more than once in a small single-purpose PreferenceController, but if
# this file build-fails or the change lands in the wrong spot, open the
# decompiled OneUIVersionPreferenceController.smali, confirm
# isDeviceWithMicroVersion()Z is the only place with that pattern, and convert
# this to a method-scoped PATCH using the real `.method ...` declaration line.

FILE smali_classes4/com/samsung/android/settings/deviceinfo/softwareinfo/OneUIVersionPreferenceController.smali
FIND_REPLACE "move-result p0" "const/4 p0, 0x1"
END
